  "quoteCount": 73,
  "friendLines": [
    {
      "title": "初次见面…",
      "desc": "我是来自璃月的厨师香菱，最擅长的是做各种捞…捞，料理…哎呀，练了那么多次，还是会紧张，嘿。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_draw_appear",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e8/j816336nczz00zb3kqzxxnuve3ub5w2.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·点心",
      "desc": "要吃点点心休息一下吗？我准备了一箩！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_explore_idle_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8d/pjv36i471ij6raegido6rhkoauasni1.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·火史莱姆",
      "desc": "火史莱姆，是椒盐…还是做成蒜香的好呢？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_explore_idle_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/lt28ql7ruk51h4dhp9iszgacrdwiz8z.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·觅食",
      "desc": "嗯，闲着也是闲着，还不如一起找找食材去！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_explore_idle_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/82/0x85rxc7gr1g387w2e5xwa92f5srxsv.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "下雨的时候·态度",
      "desc": "嗯…我不太喜欢雨天。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_weather_heavyRain_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b0/6kt8gmkc9zreccymsx086pldsjwdrae.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "下雨的时候·疏忽",
      "desc": "我想想…今天有没有晒衣服出去…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_weather_heavyRain_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8f/5ja8hystvq2m5zattzz3yiei2hgjsd0.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "雨过天晴…",
      "desc": "走走走，我带你去找松茸！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_weather_afterRain_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c0/gvsir8x5y0p64hagh0yh4n4jz1cffbl.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "起风的时候…",
      "desc": "风史莱姆最喜欢在这种天气活动，快趁机多收集点儿！我给你做史莱姆沙冰！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_weather_breezy_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/29/j8da7pmlmcpb7rluxemaz24mqmyzexw.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "早上好…",
      "desc": "来得正好！一起去补充点食材吧？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_dialog_greetingMorning",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/db/nv6fr9vkywzu667px7zrvtwjuc0goh1.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "中午好…",
      "desc": "午饭已经做好了，快过来吃哦！啊呜…来晚了可就没了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_dialog_greetingNoon",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bf/08w7hpu19tp9mmbd7ksmmva175dg33v.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚上好…",
      "desc": "要吃夜宵吗？我这正好做了串炭烤岩蜥蜴。哎呀，别盯着了，快尝尝吧！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_dialog_greetingNight",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/i2frih9dymgutjfhgcqrgp44nr3x510.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚安…",
      "desc": "喂…你不会是想背着我偷偷吃什么好东西吧？哦，只是休息啊…嘿嘿，那晚安喔。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_dialog_greetingNight2",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/48/8wmu7afxf0a2ubjran9ctghg5o4blpa.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于香菱自己…",
      "desc": "你见过蒙德城的龙？有多大？哇，不是吧。那要是做成龙肉排——嗯，该有多棒啊！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_dialog_idle",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/74/8m4m40d1pq5p8h54bq5zr2qcgo12lei.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·长处",
      "desc": "虽然比起认路我更擅长做饭，但…不管啦，出门喊我准没错！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_dialog_close1",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f6/3jxjtvkjt35zlqef5nmielk59reg7v3.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·新知识",
      "desc": "自从认识你，我好像学会了不少料理以外的知识。欸？呃…你问我都有些什么？嗯…嗯…你突然这样问，我又有点想不起来了。算了算了，我原本就不擅长这些，还是给你做两道新菜尝尝吧！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_dialog_close2",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ae/0sp9b2t2tik7x8ooagobuz7fonmg5ab.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「神之眼」…",
      "desc": "无论什么时候，我都要做出所有人都爱吃的料理。神一定也认为这是正确的事情，才授予了我这个连大师父也没有的「神之眼」…唔，怎么说来着…哦，以资鼓励！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_dialog_pendant",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cb/11c9zqpvwwz3nmbusosj9sskm8q89vw.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "有什么想要分享…",
      "desc": "如果拉肚子了，喝一杯霓裳花泡的茶就会好的！欸？我懂一点食疗方法也不用奇怪吧！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_dialog_share",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/ba/gbpz16m15loasthkvptsavayn2bcpug.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "感兴趣的见闻…",
      "desc": "我喜欢洋葱！…我试过十几种切洋葱不会流泪的方法，没一个对我有用。但这也阻止不了我喜欢洋葱！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_pref_gift",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/30/8drobfdv7vvgzcmuf2pb3c5di994njp.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于白术…",
      "desc": "嗯？我闻到了雾虚花的香气！是白先生，白先生来帮你看病了吗？你是哪里不舒服，头晕还是胃疼？还是嗓子痒？还是没力气？哦…没生病啊。那还好。不然白先生会给你超——苦的药哦。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_baizhu_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d6/3gvkp4pso1sez9gj4l73eivbe6kgbrv.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于凝光…",
      "desc": "哦！刚才那个，是「天权」大人啊…嗯，你凑过来点。再，再过来点。我跟你说哦，她可是一个特别厉害的人，港内的事情她什么都知道。所以，你也要小心一点，不要被她盯上了…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_ningguang_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/tasmajvn1g8u675sg0ydeg27qk2dlu8.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于胡桃…",
      "desc": "唔，你是不是也被胡桃欺负过？她老是趁我不注意躲到我后面，这样突然拍我的后背，得逞了还嘿嘿地笑，哼。但我大人大量，看在她每次都会给我带酿梅花做线花糕的份上，才没跟她斤斤计较。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_hutao_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7c/pq5p0w4azkdo9945yof8nbfqgy0mwbd.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于迪奥娜…",
      "desc": "清泉镇的迪奥娜！啊啊，听说她能调出特别好喝的酒，我专门拜访过她！想着如果能把调酒的秘方借鉴到料理上，说不定也能做出美味。但是，她给我的秘方，比如啤酒里泡蜥蜴尾巴，蒲公英酒里放小块熏鱼…做出来都不是很好吃。呜，果然还是要靠自己吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_diona_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/39/f1i820pp86pvpr7cl7cc0ufgczf4gw6.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于北斗…",
      "desc": "北斗姐姐人特别好！跟着她出去航海的话，每次都能捕获到好多新鲜的食材！章鱼脚拿来煲汤最好，海天青就要用辣椒好好炝一炝。不光北斗姐姐，「南十字」的船员们都很喜欢我做的菜呢。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_beidou_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/51/a5em5nd3y3jkz6rlwuxtqmhv8sd9w56.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于钟离…",
      "desc": "我遇到过不少挑剔的食客，但像钟离先生那种嘴巴上讲究，还能一针见血的，真的就只有他一个！那天我给他上的第一道菜是「椒盐豆腐」，他只尝了一口，就问我用的是什么盐，然后又说什么「不妨试试孤云阁浅海处提炼的海盐吧，它的层次感能够为豆腐赋予更多鲜味」。我试过之后味道真的大有不同。你说，他是不是好厉害！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_zhongli_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/d0jq5y5e12ncxp25udwlzqmux9blqgs.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于重云…",
      "desc": "重云啊，他总是跟着行秋一起来「万民堂」吃饭…呃，或者应该说，是被行秋拖来的？但是重云不吃热食。每次热菜上桌，行秋就会客客气气地说一声「失敬」，然后动起筷子逐一评点起每道菜的美味之处，他那夸得呀，我都想冲过去尝一口！你是没见到重云那种眼神，哈哈哈。还挺有趣的呢，他俩。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_chongyun_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/39/3cc3m0qbr5nvell3q9edxuab1ogubew.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于甘雨…",
      "desc": "甘雨？嗯…啊啊有印象有印象，是那位只吃素食的客人吧！她来「万民堂」的次数不算多，每次都是一个人躲在小角落里不吭声地吃着饭。我嘛，看她孤孤单单有些可怜，就总帮她多舀两大勺菜。没想到，她每次都能全部吃完！真是不可貌相。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_ganyu_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/02/sdpjzas42vs62cmgh5agwx21fi07po3.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于瑶瑶…",
      "desc": "嘿嘿，她啊，是我引以为豪的小师妹喔！不过呀，她很久没来「万民堂」玩儿了。是大师父放心不下吧…哼，明明生的云来大章鱼那么好吃，瑶瑶上次不光不让我吃，还叫上大师父一起训斥我，呜…有时候真不知道，到底谁才是师姐了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_yaoyao_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/02/dln09rr8irnihilwjo8beb2bcgbek5p.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于辛焱…",
      "desc": "辛焱经常来「万民堂」吃夜宵喔！像行秋、重云他们不敢试吃的新品，辛焱就会毫不犹豫地下筷…而且有八成以上的概率喜欢！哎，真是很不错的人呐。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_xinyan_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/48/s01cc4518q1vqohi44qqpdv0t3aba1u.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于夜兰…",
      "desc": "夜兰姐？我当然记得她啦。第一次见面时，我还猜她会喜欢那种清淡的菜式，没想到她是我见过最能吃辣的客人！菜肴里的辣味她觉得不够，居然把绝云椒椒直接嚼来吃！真了不起。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_yelan_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/85/d4tme65csp1xxz6ln9gggcvnvwu0g1c.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于嘉明…",
      "desc": "哎呀，知道嘉明要来，我就会早早备上一大壶茶水，方便他涮辣菜。我提议说给他做一份不辣的，但他却摆着手说就喜欢原汁原味的配方…不会错的，那不是客套话，我能分辨出真正食客的眼神！嘿嘿，那我当然也不能让他失望啦！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_gaming_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9f/o596ikwrcr84iv2jd5ylrva2i1a2zhz.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于蓝砚…",
      "desc": "锅巴很喜欢她！第一天见面就不停地跟她握手，不知道的还以为他们认识了很久呢哈哈！我已经跟蓝师傅约好啦，让她带我去抓昆虫，采野蕈…嘻嘻，等我的新菜创作出来之后，你们都要来吃哦！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_teammate_lanyan_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cc/323w3q6a1yvhd4awwwjqnv3zekkivn4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解香菱·其一",
      "desc": "烤鸽子肉，来两串？哎呀~尝尝嘛。加了我的独门秘方，绝对跟其他家的不一样！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_friendship_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/35/029d2u24x4iau969q4dq7pawxb43jvk.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解香菱·其二",
      "desc": "大师父教我的枪法，很厉害吧？你想学的话我也可以教给你哦！不过说到这个…要是你愿意跟我学厨就好了！我的这些技巧和配方，要流传得远远的才好呢。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_friendship_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9b/304sx0bhs3kov0ki5kszs8wope9l53i.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解香菱·其三",
      "desc": "问我的愿望吗？那当然是要创造全新的新菜系！璃菜和月菜都是有极限的。哦，关键一定在于辣味吧！事不宜迟，让我爆炒个锅巴辣椒给你尝尝！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_friendship_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b2/0bwqss8xc6v8ommpm0xlhzplz5jmnax.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解香菱·其四",
      "desc": "嗯！我看你已经快被我的厨艺征服了嘛~是时候给你品尝我苦心研制的新菜品了——七彩琉璃大煎饼。喏喏，这薄薄一层蛋皮里面包着红色的松鼠火腿，橙色的胡萝卜，黄色的太阳蛙肉，绿色的嘟嘟莲，蓝色的蝴蝶翅膀…呃？真的不想吃吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_friendship_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4c/03v7b8q029pyjbirf2zjpf4ord6fx98.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解香菱·其五",
      "desc": "我…有点想不明白，明明以前睡一觉就好了的，这可不是我的风格。啊呀，不行！还是让你来想吧！嗯…我很想让你一直试吃我的新菜，但不知道从什么时候起，如果你吃坏了肚子，我也会特别难受。我，我到底该怎么办呢？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_friendship_05",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/86/922mhccaqdimt7urs71i41ff2t30lml.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "香菱的爱好…",
      "desc": "看着点哦！像这样烧热一锅油，然后，把去掉翅膀的晶蝶这样放下去炸…哎呀你别走啊，超香的啦！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_pref_hobby",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/25/ogv94aehqnc7c9pv99go0uwqq80ntzo.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "香菱的烦恼…",
      "desc": "呜，史莱姆滑蘑菇一份也没卖出去。就因为卖相不好吗？口感明明很棒的呀…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_dialog_annoyed",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/ksm2zd18y06o17t9p558a5p1guzy4ue.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "喜欢的食物…",
      "desc": "喜欢的食物呀，嘿，那当然是尚且不知道味道的新菜啦！欸，我这样回答很狡猾？呜，明明说的是实话嘛。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_pref_foodLike",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e4/ea73q9s8n1lc6w2utxdcr4k6ndi7waq.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "讨厌的食物…",
      "desc": "我是不会对食物有什么偏见的！只有不合适的做法，没有不合格的食物！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_pref_foodDislike",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ee/cvkl67d49ageeq62if56xx6p81csgpk.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其一",
      "desc": "哇，这就是…「噼咔」的味道！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_spice_pref_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cb/11dqx5hwp00xe5iuqyx7y0ilom740sy.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其二",
      "desc": "嗯，你做菜真有一套。下次就换我来露两手吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_spice_normal_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8d/fmuvilfhgxyi61kiqcf4bade6jn8qav.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其三",
      "desc": "难道是做法的问题吗？总觉得哪里怪怪的…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_spice_dislike_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/bglk1zm2f54emhcck7bahbfb1slrumr.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "生日…",
      "desc": "啊，找到你了！快来，我给你做了一整桌的菜喔！嘿嘿，不用急着夸我，先等你尝过味道再慢慢说吧！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_pref_birthday",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/6hb4jjkyvrqvqkshlv7qq3kl901uupz.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·起",
      "desc": "呼哇~！好爽！全身上下都充满了力量！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_starUp_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ed/bpd98sxkqm9qzya375fekoi8cxj63bx.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·承",
      "desc": "嘿、哈！好！一拳就能把野物打晕…保证食材新鲜！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_starUp_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7d/7drctzeaxnmnughh5awk3ai1szm1fkk.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·转",
      "desc": "有这种力量的话…终于可以…不好，口水要流下来了！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_starUp_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b5/2gptnsvczdp6f93i9sn555i2qzrh7s8.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·合",
      "desc": "父亲曾经说过：「想做出十分的菜肴，就要投入十二分的热情。」我懂的、我懂的！能走到今天这个地步，一定是因为有你付出了十二分的热情陪我练习。嗯，那我也要再加倍…用再加倍的热情来回应你！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_xiangling/vo_xiangling_starUp_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/d6jerwmqo051y4mml2ph81tlkre8pcs.ogg"
    }
  ],
